{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00140",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.86,
      "end_seconds": 7.34,
      "duration_seconds": 6.48,
      "text": "Hi there, um, is it alright if I come in now?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 7.98,
      "end_seconds": 13.52,
      "duration_seconds": 5.54,
      "text": "Right, no trouble at all, come in. What's been bothering you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 15.4,
      "end_seconds": 22.52,
      "duration_seconds": 7.12,
      "text": "Doctor, I've come along because I know the history, if it helps."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 23.56,
      "end_seconds": 26.67,
      "duration_seconds": 3.11,
      "text": "Please do. Extra information is always welcome."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 27.92,
      "end_seconds": 33.9,
      "duration_seconds": 5.98,
      "text": "Well, I've been having itching that wakes me at night."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 35.63,
      "end_seconds": 38.54,
      "duration_seconds": 2.91,
      "text": "How long has this been going on?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 39.88,
      "end_seconds": 43.43,
      "duration_seconds": 3.55,
      "text": "I've had it for about a month."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 44.57,
      "end_seconds": 49.63,
      "duration_seconds": 5.06,
      "text": "Okay, give me more detail on it, whatever comes to mind."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 51.06,
      "end_seconds": 58.36,
      "duration_seconds": 7.3,
      "text": "Pretty severe, if I'm being honest. I'd say a few times a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 59.76,
      "end_seconds": 63.24,
      "duration_seconds": 3.48,
      "text": "So, does it come along with anything else?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 65.07,
      "end_seconds": 73.07,
      "duration_seconds": 8.0,
      "text": "Cracked skin on my hands goes along with it, most of the time."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 74.12,
      "end_seconds": 77.2,
      "duration_seconds": 3.08,
      "text": "Has there been dry, scaly patches too?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 78.51,
      "end_seconds": 98.51,
      "duration_seconds": 20.0,
      "text": "Uh, yes, for one week. About dry, scaly patches, moderate, I'd say. Uh, the cracked skin on my hands? That's been for three weeks. Right, as for cracked skin on my hands, I'd say severe."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 99.11,
      "end_seconds": 107.06,
      "duration_seconds": 7.95,
      "text": "Have you had itching that wakes you at night before, or is this the first time?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 107.78,
      "end_seconds": 115.83,
      "duration_seconds": 8.05,
      "text": "Yes, uh, something like this happened last winter, and it went away on its own."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 133.81,
      "end_seconds": 136.71,
      "duration_seconds": 2.9,
      "text": "Alright, any similar rash in family members?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 137.48,
      "end_seconds": 142.77,
      "duration_seconds": 5.29,
      "text": "Not at all, no similar rash in family members."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 145.95,
      "end_seconds": 150.23,
      "duration_seconds": 4.28,
      "text": "And what about breathing trouble, oozing or joint pain?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 151.04,
      "end_seconds": 153.43,
      "duration_seconds": 2.39,
      "text": "No, none of those."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 154.34,
      "end_seconds": 155.65,
      "duration_seconds": 1.31,
      "text": "Neurologically, anything strange?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 156.41,
      "end_seconds": 160.02,
      "duration_seconds": 3.61,
      "text": "No, uh, nothing like that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 161.33,
      "end_seconds": 164.15,
      "duration_seconds": 2.82,
      "text": "Any diagnoses you've been given before?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 168.87,
      "end_seconds": 170.38,
      "duration_seconds": 1.51,
      "text": "I have eczema."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 172.26,
      "end_seconds": 178.99,
      "duration_seconds": 6.73,
      "text": "Okay, I can see eczema in your file as well. Any allergies I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 180.55,
      "end_seconds": 185.38,
      "duration_seconds": 4.83,
      "text": "Uh, you know, no, no allergies to anything."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 186.89,
      "end_seconds": 190.99,
      "duration_seconds": 4.1,
      "text": "Let's talk a little about your daily life and habits."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 192.84,
      "end_seconds": 214.19,
      "duration_seconds": 21.35,
      "text": "A beer or two most evenings, to be honest. I smoke about ten cigarettes a day. I eat out quite a lot, to be honest. It's just me and my wife at home now. I walk for about half an hour most days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 215.01,
      "end_seconds": 218.59,
      "duration_seconds": 3.58,
      "text": "Let's go through your medication. What are you taking?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 220.61,
      "end_seconds": 225.02,
      "duration_seconds": 4.41,
      "text": "Uh, it's hydrocortisone cream, when needed, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 226.02,
      "end_seconds": 229.03,
      "duration_seconds": 3.01,
      "text": "How long has that been going on?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 230.8,
      "end_seconds": 235.73,
      "duration_seconds": 4.93,
      "text": "About nearly five years. It's moisturiser, twice a day, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 236.61,
      "end_seconds": 239.18,
      "duration_seconds": 2.57,
      "text": "Have you had any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 240.47,
      "end_seconds": 242.05,
      "duration_seconds": 1.58,
      "text": "No operations, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 255.65,
      "end_seconds": 258.51,
      "duration_seconds": 2.86,
      "text": "I'll take a few measurements first."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 269.45,
      "end_seconds": 271.12,
      "duration_seconds": 1.67,
      "text": "Just relax your arm..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 286.17,
      "end_seconds": 295.87,
      "duration_seconds": 9.7,
      "text": "Okay: BP is 109 over 76, temperature is 36.5 degrees, pulse is 82 beats a minute. And oxygen saturation is 99 percent."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 298.83,
      "end_seconds": 302.17,
      "duration_seconds": 3.34,
      "text": "Right, let me check a few things physically."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 316.66,
      "end_seconds": 317.94,
      "duration_seconds": 1.28,
      "text": "Mm, okay."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 319.16,
      "end_seconds": 323.5,
      "duration_seconds": 4.34,
      "text": "A little pressure here, tell me if it's tender."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 334.68,
      "end_seconds": 341.37,
      "duration_seconds": 6.69,
      "text": "There are dry red patches in the creases of both elbows with scratch marks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 346.96,
      "end_seconds": 363.22,
      "duration_seconds": 16.26,
      "text": "That's fine, sit up. So, based on the history and the examination, it's hard to say. An eczema flare-up is one possibility and contact dermatitis another, and I'd rather not commit yet."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 365.26,
      "end_seconds": 368.39,
      "duration_seconds": 3.13,
      "text": "Should I be worried about this?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 369.54,
      "end_seconds": 394.35,
      "duration_seconds": 24.81,
      "text": "Nothing I've seen today points to an emergency. It looks like an eczema flare-up. Let's use cetirizine, 10 milligrams, at night, for one week. That's for itching. Moisturise right after a bath, thick creams are better than lotions, and use a mild soap. What are the next steps as you understand them?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 395.91,
      "end_seconds": 402.26,
      "duration_seconds": 6.35,
      "text": "So, I take the cetirizine, 10 milligrams, at night. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 404.29,
      "end_seconds": 409.3,
      "duration_seconds": 5.01,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. Is there anything you wanted to ask?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 411.13,
      "end_seconds": 413.44,
      "duration_seconds": 2.31,
      "text": "Thanks so much, doctor."
    }
  ]
}